{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EumKLaGkqf6FMDLwTMxTaR","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{"commits":[{"hash":"e8126b39dc10bcdc719250b004afe86f7782f36a","date":"2026-06-04T14:23:05+05:30","message":"(feat) O3-5413: Add bill refunds (#738)","refs":"","body":"* feat(refunds): add bill refunds feature\n\n- Cashiers can request refunds on PAID/PARTIALLY_REFUNDED bills; admins approve or reject; cashiers then process approved refunds to COMPLETED\n- Supports bill-level and line-item-scoped refunds with cumulative cap enforcement; at most one active refund per scope at a time\n- Adds admin Refund Requests page, cashier Request Refund modal, and admin Review Bill Refunds modal with receipt rail showing approved and completed refund totals\n- Fixes: REJECTED refunds were incorrectly reducing remainingRefundable; COMPLETED refunds were not deducted from line-item remaining (double-refund risk); bill.refunds?.filter().reduce() crashed when refunds was undefined\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(refunds): add pending refunds filter to bills table\n\nAdds REFUND_REQUESTED to BillStatus and a 'Pending refunds' filter option in the bills table to surface bills awaiting refund processing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(refunds): address SonarCloud issues in refunds feature\n\n- Extract deeply nested onRefundRequest/onClick callbacks into named functions\n- Replace chained ternaries with if/else block before JSX return\n- Add null guard in handleRequestRefund to remove non-null assertions\n- Use flatMap for type-safe lineItemUuid set construction\n- Remove unnecessary `as RefundStatus` cast (type already narrows correctly)\n- Replace role=\"progressbar\" on div with aria-busy=\"true\"\n- Mark component props interfaces as readonly\n- Replace window with globalThis in test files\n- Remove unused showSnackbar and useOpenmrsFetchAll imports\n- Replace parseFloat with Number.parseFloat\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(refunds): remove unnecessary non-null assertion in handleLineItemRefundRequest\n\nAdd early return guard for item.uuid so TypeScript narrows the type,\nmaking the ! assertion redundant and satisfying SonarCloud S4325.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(refunds): keep review modal open on action and fix multi-line refund eligibility\n\n- Review modal now refreshes bill data in place instead of closing after approve/reject\n- Bills in REFUND_REQUESTED status can now accept refund requests on unaffected line items\n- Add unit tests covering all refund eligibility scenarios (bill-level and line-level blocking)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(refunds): mock billing.resource in review-bill-refunds modal test\n\nuseBill was added to the modal but the test's esm-framework mock did not\nexpose openmrsFetch, causing the test suite to fail on push.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(refunds): resolve duplicate translation key and add voided discount test\n\n- Align refundAmount translation value to 'Refund amount' across all usages\n- Add test asserting voided discounts are not rendered in DiscountsTable\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(refunds): add void action to refund review card\n\nAdmins can now void any refund regardless of status. Follows the same\ninline-confirm pattern as the discount card's delete action.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(refunds): improve refund review modal and validation\n\n- Rename `busy` → `processingRefundId`/`disabled` in RefundCard and RefundReviewStack for clearer semantics\n- Add per-line-item refund cap validation before approving\n- Fix over-approval guard to exclude the refund being approved from committed total\n- Show progress bar alongside content instead of replacing it during loading\n- Add inline error state when bill data fails to load\n- Guard against null netAmount in invoice refund handler\n- Switch requestRefundModal and reviewBillRefundsModal to async lifecycle\n- Make MappedBill.netAmount non-optional\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(refunds): reconcile summary card figures when discount and prior refunds exist\n\nShow amountAfterDiscount as the bill-level scope total in the summary card, and\nadd an 'Already refunded' row (hidden when zero) so all three figures always\nadd up visually regardless of discounts or prior refunds on the same bill.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Cleanup props\n\n* feat(refunds): show tooltip on disabled Request refund button\n\nWraps the button in a Carbon Tooltip (only when disabled) to explain\nthat a line-item refund is already in progress, and adds unit tests\ncovering the disabled state and tooltip label.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(refunds): surface void as delete in UI and add coverage for line-item and void flows\n\nReplaces all user-facing \"void\" language with \"delete\" to match the\nconvention used for discounts, line items, and bills. Adds tests for\nline-item-scoped refund approval (including the exceeds-line-total\nguard) and the full delete confirmation flow.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(refunds): show already-refunded row for line items with prior completed refunds\n\nComputes alreadyRefunded symmetrically for line-item refunds using\nscopeTotal - remainingRefundable, matching the bill-level calculation.\nThe summary card now shows the \"Already refunded\" row whenever a line\nitem has prior completed refunds, making the figures add up correctly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(refunds): close concurrent-action races and i18n gaps\n\n- Disable Approve/Confirm reject/Confirm delete across all cards while\n  any request is in flight (was only guarding the active card's UUID)\n- Add tests covering cross-card Approve and Confirm-reject lock-out\n- Remove dead useBillRefunds export and its test block\n- Add extraction hint block + en.json keys for all BillStatus values\n  so the receipt-rail status tag never falls back to raw enum strings\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(refunds): remove redundant non-null assertions flagged by SonarCloud\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(refunds): suppress false invalid state on empty NumberInput on open\n\nAdd allowEmpty to the NumberInput in the refund and discount modals so\nCarbon's internal emptiness check does not trigger the red invalid state\nbefore the user has typed anything. Submit gating is unaffected.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(refunds): keep confirmation footer contained at narrow modal widths\n\nSplit confirmation copy from its button group into a wrapping flex row so\nthe text and controls stack vertically rather than overflow at narrow widths.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","authorName":"Nethmi Rodrigo","authorEmail":"nethmi@openmrs.org"},{"hash":"4aa8e4c993d5fe06147c9561c949a6da36aea47e","date":"2026-06-02T17:36:06+05:30","message":"(feat) O3-5421: Add visit-bills panel showing visit-scoped bills in visit summary (#741)","refs":"","body":"* feat: add visit-bills-panel showing visit-scoped bills in visit summary\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address SonarCloud issues in visit-bills-panel\n\n- Use stable header.key instead of array index in DataTable header keys\n- Replace window with globalThis in test setup for env-agnostic access\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: resolve i18next-parser duplicate key warnings\n\n- Use `loadingDescription` for aria-label \"Loading\" (bills-table, discount-requests)\n  instead of reusing `loading` with a different default value\n- Introduce `invoiceNo` key for abbreviated \"Invoice #\" (discount-requests,\n  printable-invoice-header) so `invoiceNumber` stays consistently \"Invoice number\"\n- Normalise `totalAmount` default to sentence-case \"Total amount\" in printable invoice\n- Introduce `deleteBillFailedTryAgain` key for the bill-deletion error message,\n  separate from the existing line-item-specific `deleteFailedTryAgain`\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(e2e): update invoiceNumberLabel locator to match renamed translation\n\nThe `invoiceNumber` key in translations/en.json was changed from \"Invoice #\"\nto \"Invoice number\" in 99a36cc. Update the e2e locator to match.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (chore) Bump billing backend dependency and fix stale invoiceNumber translations\n\n- Raise backendDependencies billing version to >=2.3.0-0 to include SNAPSHOT builds\n- Update invoiceNumber label to \"Invoice number\" across all locale files to align with the invoiceNo/invoiceNumber key split\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (test) Add viewOnly regression tests for InvoiceTable\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (fix) Use getCoreTranslation for loading aria-label in BillsTable\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (fix) Remove redundant progressbar role from BillsTable loader container\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (fix) Remove redundant progressbar role from BillsTable loader container\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (chore) Revert non-English translation file changes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (chore) Revert non-English translation file changes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>","authorName":"Nethmi Rodrigo","authorEmail":"nethmi@openmrs.org"},{"hash":"e5b80768f3166c82b2db7c710e166adf01ce3f70","date":"2026-05-26T01:06:06+05:30","message":"(fix) O3-5708: Keep discount review modal open after approve/reject/delete actions (#744)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Nethmi Rodrigo","authorEmail":"nethmi@openmrs.org"},{"hash":"5127b0c031addf584cc49f6252272121d50c5cad","date":"2026-05-18T22:22:25+05:30","message":"(feat) O3-5417: Add bill discounts feature (#732)","refs":"","body":"* (feat) Add bill discounts feature\n\nReplaces bill waivers with a structured discounts workflow:\n- Per-line-item discount requests via request-discount modal\n- Discounts table on invoice and printable invoice\n- Admin dashboard for reviewing pending discount requests\n- Review-bill-discounts modal with line items, payments, totals,\n  and receipt rail\n- Discount entry points wired into invoice page and left-panel\n- Privilege-aware visibility (useHasPrivilege, feature flag hook)\n- Server-sourced bill totals via mapBillProperties\n- BillDiscount type contract and discount resource hooks\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (test) Add e2e tests for bill discounts workflow\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (fix) Update e2e page objects for new invoice layout\n\n* (test) Purge bill discounts before bill in e2e cleanup\n\n* (test) Skip bill discount e2e pending backend purge support\n\nBackend BillDiscountResource.purge throws UnsupportedOperationException, so\nthe discount workflow spec leaks bills and patients between runs. Skip it and\ncomment out the discount-cleanup helper until backend purge support lands.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (fix) Address PR review comments on bill discounts\n\n- Differentiate Delete button styling from Reject (kind=\"danger\")\n- Use custom REST representation instead of v=full for discount requests\n- Drop redundant optional chaining on bill in payments breakdown\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (fix) Use default rep, memoize modal callbacks, memoize children\n\n- Revert custom REST representation to `default` (backend doesn't\n  serialize nested discount status under custom projections)\n- Wrap modal handlers in useCallback and children in React.memo\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (fix) Address more PR review comments on bill discounts\n\n- Use translation key for Discount requests link title\n- Drop stale useState snapshot of bill prop in review modal\n- Preserve non-Error throws in extractErrorMessage fallback\n- Let InvoiceTable accept discount data as optional props to dedupe fetch with Invoice\n- Share line item total calculation between modal payload and table row\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","authorName":"Nethmi Rodrigo","authorEmail":"nethmi@openmrs.org"},{"hash":"db22701b986ae73bc876df2327fa0f82a7fd3ed5","date":"2026-04-22T02:08:55+05:30","message":"(feat) Add delete action for pending bills (#717)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Nethmi Rodrigo","authorEmail":"nethmi@openmrs.org"},{"hash":"c1139db6f410c576cfcdec7d226edc58ef7728ee","date":"2026-02-13T21:44:37+03:00","message":"(fix) Improve delete line item confirmation modal (#629)","refs":"","body":"Show the item name in the confirmation message and add a 255-character\nlimit to the deletion reason textarea to align with the backend's\nvarchar(255) constraint.","authorName":"Dennis Kigen","authorEmail":"kigen.work@gmail.com"},{"hash":"6e3d447cbfade14f3ec4b73d1697daf8f203bf79","date":"2026-02-13T16:17:05+05:30","message":"(fix) Delete line items from a bill (#617)","refs":"","body":"The billing tables had several inconsistencies: the \"Visit time\" column\nwas misleadingly named (it's actually `dateCreated`), there was no\nreceipt/invoice number column for navigating to invoices, the patient\nname was a link to the invoice page (unintuitive), and the billed items\ndisplay had a trailing \"&\" when a line item lacked a name.\n\n- Rename \"Visit time\" to \"Bill date\" across all billing tables\n- Add \"Invoice number\" column linking to the invoice page in the bill\n  list, bill history, and patient bills tables\n- Remove clickable link from patient name in the bill list table\n- Rename \"Bill code\" to \"Invoice number\" in the invoice line items table\n- Fix trailing \"&\" in billed items by replacing reduce with\n  map/filter/join\n- Update unit tests and e2e tests to reflect the new column structure\n","authorName":"Nethmi Rodrigo","authorEmail":"nethmi@openmrs.org"},{"hash":"418da3aea95003c4fd049a6c56e9af2633c6ecd2","date":"2025-12-04T01:17:54+05:30","message":"(feat) O3-5201: Add support for removing line items from bills  (#568)","refs":"","body":"Adds functionality to delete individual line items from bills through a confirmation modal with proper error handling, loading states, and automatic data revalidation.","authorName":"sourav-jyoti","authorEmail":"148575647+sourav-jyoti@users.noreply.github.com"},{"hash":"25d4115148143e9d5d5f57229167bfcaa997ea5e","date":"2025-11-10T15:54:51+03:00","message":"(test) Remove unused billable service and bill helper functions","refs":"","body":"Removes `createBillableService`, `deleteBillableService`, and `getBill` helpers\nthat are not currently used by any E2E tests. Makes `getBillableService`\nprivate as it's only used internally by `ensureServiceHasPrices`.\n\nCurrent tests use existing services via `E2E_TEST_SERVICE_UUID` rather than\ndynamically creating services.\n","authorName":"Dennis Kigen","authorEmail":"kigen.work@gmail.com"},{"hash":"b7162ecff5e9cf2409d55b944244ec0de244d3e7","date":"2025-10-23T01:51:39+03:00","message":"(feat) O3-5141: Add ability to edit payment methods (#452)","refs":"","body":"* Add ability to edit payment methods\n\n* minor fixes\n\n* Allow cash point create and update with two different functions\n\n* Useful refactorings\n\n- Rename `add-payment-mode.modal.tsx` to `payment-mode-form.modal.tsx` to reflect dual add/edit purpose\n- Add proper TypeScript types (PaymentMode interface) exported from resource file\n- Fix test mock to use jest.fn() instead of null for mutate function\n- Implement proper cache invalidation using useSWRConfig for add/edit/delete operations\n- Add UUID validation with optional chaining in edit mode\n- Restore errorFetchingPaymentModes translation key for consistency\n- Remove callback prop drilling in favor of direct cache invalidation\n- Consolidate duplicate PaymentMode interface definitions\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>","authorName":"abertnamanya","authorEmail":"abertnamanya@gmail.com"},{"hash":"24096120c5407e95a9433427251f61d629df6a91","date":"2025-10-17T02:42:22+05:30","message":"(fix) O3-5116: Close modal after editing billable service (#428)","refs":"","body":"* (fix) O3-5116: Close modal after editing billable service\n\n* updated translation for delete payment mode\n\n* updated\n\n* fixup\n\n* fix price input\n\n* Fixup\n\n1. Fix Concept UUID Capture - Changes concept type from ConceptSearchResult to { uuid: string; display: string }\n2. Fix Concept Initialization - When editing an existing service, properly extracts only `uuid` and `display` from `serviceToEdit.concept`\n3. Fix Translation Interpolation - Changes `{searchTerm}` → `{{searchTerm}}` (correct i18next syntax)\n4. Loader Styling Update - Updates CSS for the loader component\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>","authorName":"praneeth","authorEmail":"praneeth7077@gmail.com"},{"hash":"9c12676f7dd257f47f5ff22f4055fd6e0fd05ee9","date":"2025-10-15T21:55:32+03:00","message":"(fix) Exclude voided items from bill calculations (#437)","refs":"","body":"* (fix) Exclude voided items from bill calculations\n\nVoided (soft-deleted) line items were being included in bill totals,\nstatus calculations, and item lists, causing incorrect amounts and\nmisleading bill statuses.\n\nChanges:\n- Filter voided items in mapBillProperties before all calculations\n- Use calculateTotalAmount helper in bill waiver (includes voided check)\n- Refactor promise chains to async/await with try/catch/finally\n- Improve URL building in useBills with server-side status filtering\n- Add currency formatting for all price displays\n- Translate hardcoded strings in billing checkin form\n- Add accessibility improvements (aria-live on dynamic totals)\n- Remove unused code and imports\n\nTests:\n- Fix edit-bill-item tests broken by currency formatting changes\n- Add form validation test coverage for quantity constraints\n- Verify validation errors appear/clear correctly\n- Ensure submission is blocked with invalid data\n\nImpact: Bills with voided items will now show correct totals and status.\nPreviously, a fully paid bill could incorrectly show as PENDING if it\ncontained voided items.\n\n* Additional fix: register edit bill line item modal using modal system","authorName":"Dennis Kigen","authorEmail":"kigen.work@gmail.com"},{"hash":"cf4c767693faa707a9b1a2bf51b3e70ab936d37f","date":"2025-08-30T01:10:27+05:30","message":"(chore) Require @openmrs/esm-framework 8.x in peerDependencies (#350)","refs":"","body":"* Require @openmrs/esm-framework 8.x in peerDependencies\n\n* Delete .idea files","authorName":"Jayasanka Weerasinghe","authorEmail":"33048395+jayasanka-sack@users.noreply.github.com"}],"totalCount":13}"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"94fd0ca0-4e65-45b1-80de-d9a566c15989","uuid":"327c40a1-a537-4da5-aa47-4a189f23f30c","timestamp":"2026-10-23T05:44:08.017Z","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"{"commits":[{"hash":"e8126b39dc10bcdc719250b004afe86f7782f36a","date":"2026-06-04T14:23:05+05:30","message":"(feat) O3-5413: Add bill refunds (#738)","refs":"","body":"* feat(refunds): add bill refunds feature\n\n- Cashiers can request refunds on PAID/PARTIALLY_REFUNDED bills; admins approve or reject; cashiers then process approved refunds to COMPLETED\n- Supports bill-level and line-item-scoped refunds with cumulative cap enforcement; at most one active refund per scope at a time\n- Adds admin Refund Requests page, cashier Request Refund modal, and admin Review Bill Refunds modal with receipt rail showing approved and completed refund totals\n- Fixes: REJECTED refunds were incorrectly reducing remainingRefundable; COMPLETED refunds were not deducted from line-item remaining (double-refund risk); bill.refunds?.filter().reduce() crashed when refunds was undefined\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(refunds): add pending refunds filter to bills table\n\nAdds REFUND_REQUESTED to BillStatus and a 'Pending refunds' filter option in the bills table to surface bills awaiting refund processing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(refunds): address SonarCloud issues in refunds feature\n\n- Extract deeply nested onRefundRequest/onClick callbacks into named functions\n- Replace chained ternaries with if/else block before JSX return\n- Add null guard in handleRequestRefund to remove non-null assertions\n- Use flatMap for type-safe lineItemUuid set construction\n- Remove unnecessary `as RefundStatus` cast (type already narrows correctly)\n- Replace role=\"progressbar\" on div with aria-busy=\"true\"\n- Mark component props interfaces as readonly\n- Replace window with globalThis in test files\n- Remove unused showSnackbar and useOpenmrsFetchAll imports\n- Replace parseFloat with Number.parseFloat\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(refunds): remove unnecessary non-null assertion in handleLineItemRefundRequest\n\nAdd early return guard for item.uuid so TypeScript narrows the type,\nmaking the ! assertion redundant and satisfying SonarCloud S4325.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(refunds): keep review modal open on action and fix multi-line refund eligibility\n\n- Review modal now refreshes bill data in place instead of closing after approve/reject\n- Bills in REFUND_REQUESTED status can now accept refund requests on unaffected line items\n- Add unit tests covering all refund eligibility scenarios (bill-level and line-level blocking)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(refunds): mock billing.resource in review-bill-refunds modal test\n\nuseBill was added to the modal but the test's esm-framework mock did not\nexpose openmrsFetch, causing the test suite to fail on push.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(refunds): resolve duplicate translation key and add voided discount test\n\n- Align refundAmount translation value to 'Refund amount' across all usages\n- Add test asserting voided discounts are not rendered in DiscountsTable\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(refunds): add void action to refund review card\n\nAdmins can now void any refund regardless of status. Follows the same\ninline-confirm pattern as the discount card's delete action.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(refunds): improve refund review modal and validation\n\n- Rename `busy` → `processingRefundId`/`disabled` in RefundCard and RefundReviewStack for clearer semantics\n- Add per-line-item refund cap validation before approving\n- Fix over-approval guard to exclude the refund being approved from committed total\n- Show progress bar alongside content instead of replacing it during loading\n- Add inline error state when bill data fails to load\n- Guard against null netAmount in invoice refund handler\n- Switch requestRefundModal and reviewBillRefundsModal to async lifecycle\n- Make MappedBill.netAmount non-optional\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(refunds): reconcile summary card figures when discount and prior refunds exist\n\nShow amountAfterDiscount as the bill-level scope total in the summary card, and\nadd an 'Already refunded' row (hidden when zero) so all three figures always\nadd up visually regardless of discounts or prior refunds on the same bill.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Cleanup props\n\n* feat(refunds): show tooltip on disabled Request refund button\n\nWraps the button in a Carbon Tooltip (only when disabled) to explain\nthat a line-item refund is already in progress, and adds unit tests\ncovering the disabled state and tooltip label.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(refunds): surface void as delete in UI and add coverage for line-item and void flows\n\nReplaces all user-facing \"void\" language with \"delete\" to match the\nconvention used for discounts, line items, and bills. Adds tests for\nline-item-scoped refund approval (including the exceeds-line-total\nguard) and the full delete confirmation flow.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(refunds): show already-refunded row for line items with prior completed refunds\n\nComputes alreadyRefunded symmetrically for line-item refunds using\nscopeTotal - remainingRefundable, matching the bill-level calculation.\nThe summary card now shows the \"Already refunded\" row whenever a line\nitem has prior completed refunds, making the figures add up correctly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(refunds): close concurrent-action races and i18n gaps\n\n- Disable Approve/Confirm reject/Confirm delete across all cards while\n  any request is in flight (was only guarding the active card's UUID)\n- Add tests covering cross-card Approve and Confirm-reject lock-out\n- Remove dead useBillRefunds export and its test block\n- Add extraction hint block + en.json keys for all BillStatus values\n  so the receipt-rail status tag never falls back to raw enum strings\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(refunds): remove redundant non-null assertions flagged by SonarCloud\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(refunds): suppress false invalid state on empty NumberInput on open\n\nAdd allowEmpty to the NumberInput in the refund and discount modals so\nCarbon's internal emptiness check does not trigger the red invalid state\nbefore the user has typed anything. Submit gating is unaffected.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(refunds): keep confirmation footer contained at narrow modal widths\n\nSplit confirmation copy from its button group into a wrapping flex row so\nthe text and controls stack vertically rather than overflow at narrow widths.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","authorName":"Nethmi Rodrigo","authorEmail":"nethmi@openmrs.org"},{"hash":"4aa8e4c993d5fe06147c9561c949a6da36aea47e","date":"2026-06-02T17:36:06+05:30","message":"(feat) O3-5421: Add visit-bills panel showing visit-scoped bills in visit summary (#741)","refs":"","body":"* feat: add visit-bills-panel showing visit-scoped bills in visit summary\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address SonarCloud issues in visit-bills-panel\n\n- Use stable header.key instead of array index in DataTable header keys\n- Replace window with globalThis in test setup for env-agnostic access\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: resolve i18next-parser duplicate key warnings\n\n- Use `loadingDescription` for aria-label \"Loading\" (bills-table, discount-requests)\n  instead of reusing `loading` with a different default value\n- Introduce `invoiceNo` key for abbreviated \"Invoice #\" (discount-requests,\n  printable-invoice-header) so `invoiceNumber` stays consistently \"Invoice number\"\n- Normalise `totalAmount` default to sentence-case \"Total amount\" in printable invoice\n- Introduce `deleteBillFailedTryAgain` key for the bill-deletion error message,\n  separate from the existing line-item-specific `deleteFailedTryAgain`\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(e2e): update invoiceNumberLabel locator to match renamed translation\n\nThe `invoiceNumber` key in translations/en.json was changed from \"Invoice #\"\nto \"Invoice number\" in 99a36cc. Update the e2e locator to match.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (chore) Bump billing backend dependency and fix stale invoiceNumber translations\n\n- Raise backendDependencies billing version to >=2.3.0-0 to include SNAPSHOT builds\n- Update invoiceNumber label to \"Invoice number\" across all locale files to align with the invoiceNo/invoiceNumber key split\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (test) Add viewOnly regression tests for InvoiceTable\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (fix) Use getCoreTranslation for loading aria-label in BillsTable\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (fix) Remove redundant progressbar role from BillsTable loader container\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (fix) Remove redundant progressbar role from BillsTable loader container\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (chore) Revert non-English translation file changes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (chore) Revert non-English translation file changes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>","authorName":"Nethmi Rodrigo","authorEmail":"nethmi@openmrs.org"},{"hash":"e5b80768f3166c82b2db7c710e166adf01ce3f70","date":"2026-05-26T01:06:06+05:30","message":"(fix) O3-5708: Keep discount review modal open after approve/reject/delete actions (#744)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Nethmi Rodrigo","authorEmail":"nethmi@openmrs.org"},{"hash":"5127b0c031addf584cc49f6252272121d50c5cad","date":"2026-05-18T22:22:25+05:30","message":"(feat) O3-5417: Add bill discounts feature (#732)","refs":"","body":"* (feat) Add bill discounts feature\n\nReplaces bill waivers with a structured discounts workflow:\n- Per-line-item discount requests via request-discount modal\n- Discounts table on invoice and printable invoice\n- Admin dashboard for reviewing pending discount requests\n- Review-bill-discounts modal with line items, payments, totals,\n  and receipt rail\n- Discount entry points wired into invoice page and left-panel\n- Privilege-aware visibility (useHasPrivilege, feature flag hook)\n- Server-sourced bill totals via mapBillProperties\n- BillDiscount type contract and discount resource hooks\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (test) Add e2e tests for bill discounts workflow\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (fix) Update e2e page objects for new invoice layout\n\n* (test) Purge bill discounts before bill in e2e cleanup\n\n* (test) Skip bill discount e2e pending backend purge support\n\nBackend BillDiscountResource.purge throws UnsupportedOperationException, so\nthe discount workflow spec leaks bills and patients between runs. Skip it and\ncomment out the discount-cleanup helper until backend purge support lands.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (fix) Address PR review comments on bill discounts\n\n- Differentiate Delete button styling from Reject (kind=\"danger\")\n- Use custom REST representation instead of v=full for discount requests\n- Drop redundant optional chaining on bill in payments breakdown\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (fix) Use default rep, memoize modal callbacks, memoize children\n\n- Revert custom REST representation to `default` (backend doesn't\n  serialize nested discount status under custom projections)\n- Wrap modal handlers in useCallback and children in React.memo\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (fix) Address more PR review comments on bill discounts\n\n- Use translation key for Discount requests link title\n- Drop stale useState snapshot of bill prop in review modal\n- Preserve non-Error throws in extractErrorMessage fallback\n- Let InvoiceTable accept discount data as optional props to dedupe fetch with Invoice\n- Share line item total calculation between modal payload and table row\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","authorName":"Nethmi Rodrigo","authorEmail":"nethmi@openmrs.org"},{"hash":"db22701b986ae73bc876df2327fa0f82a7fd3ed5","date":"2026-04-22T02:08:55+05:30","message":"(feat) Add delete action for pending bills (#717)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Nethmi Rodrigo","authorEmail":"nethmi@openmrs.org"},{"hash":"c1139db6f410c576cfcdec7d226edc58ef7728ee","date":"2026-02-13T21:44:37+03:00","message":"(fix) Improve delete line item confirmation modal (#629)","refs":"","body":"Show the item name in the confirmation message and add a 255-character\nlimit to the deletion reason textarea to align with the backend's\nvarchar(255) constraint.","authorName":"Dennis Kigen","authorEmail":"kigen.work@gmail.com"},{"hash":"6e3d447cbfade14f3ec4b73d1697daf8f203bf79","date":"2026-02-13T16:17:05+05:30","message":"(fix) Delete line items from a bill (#617)","refs":"","body":"The billing tables had several inconsistencies: the \"Visit time\" column\nwas misleadingly named (it's actually `dateCreated`), there was no\nreceipt/invoice number column for navigating to invoices, the patient\nname was a link to the invoice page (unintuitive), and the billed items\ndisplay had a trailing \"&\" when a line item lacked a name.\n\n- Rename \"Visit time\" to \"Bill date\" across all billing tables\n- Add \"Invoice number\" column linking to the invoice page in the bill\n  list, bill history, and patient bills tables\n- Remove clickable link from patient name in the bill list table\n- Rename \"Bill code\" to \"Invoice number\" in the invoice line items table\n- Fix trailing \"&\" in billed items by replacing reduce with\n  map/filter/join\n- Update unit tests and e2e tests to reflect the new column structure\n","authorName":"Nethmi Rodrigo","authorEmail":"nethmi@openmrs.org"},{"hash":"418da3aea95003c4fd049a6c56e9af2633c6ecd2","date":"2025-12-04T01:17:54+05:30","message":"(feat) O3-5201: Add support for removing line items from bills  (#568)","refs":"","body":"Adds functionality to delete individual line items from bills through a confirmation modal with proper error handling, loading states, and automatic data revalidation.","authorName":"sourav-jyoti","authorEmail":"148575647+sourav-jyoti@users.noreply.github.com"},{"hash":"25d4115148143e9d5d5f57229167bfcaa997ea5e","date":"2025-11-10T15:54:51+03:00","message":"(test) Remove unused billable service and bill helper functions","refs":"","body":"Removes `createBillableService`, `deleteBillableService`, and `getBill` helpers\nthat are not currently used by any E2E tests. Makes `getBillableService`\nprivate as it's only used internally by `ensureServiceHasPrices`.\n\nCurrent tests use existing services via `E2E_TEST_SERVICE_UUID` rather than\ndynamically creating services.\n","authorName":"Dennis Kigen","authorEmail":"kigen.work@gmail.com"},{"hash":"b7162ecff5e9cf2409d55b944244ec0de244d3e7","date":"2025-10-23T01:51:39+03:00","message":"(feat) O3-5141: Add ability to edit payment methods (#452)","refs":"","body":"* Add ability to edit payment methods\n\n* minor fixes\n\n* Allow cash point create and update with two different functions\n\n* Useful refactorings\n\n- Rename `add-payment-mode.modal.tsx` to `payment-mode-form.modal.tsx` to reflect dual add/edit purpose\n- Add proper TypeScript types (PaymentMode interface) exported from resource file\n- Fix test mock to use jest.fn() instead of null for mutate function\n- Implement proper cache invalidation using useSWRConfig for add/edit/delete operations\n- Add UUID validation with optional chaining in edit mode\n- Restore errorFetchingPaymentModes translation key for consistency\n- Remove callback prop drilling in favor of direct cache invalidation\n- Consolidate duplicate PaymentMode interface definitions\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>","authorName":"abertnamanya","authorEmail":"abertnamanya@gmail.com"},{"hash":"24096120c5407e95a9433427251f61d629df6a91","date":"2025-10-17T02:42:22+05:30","message":"(fix) O3-5116: Close modal after editing billable service (#428)","refs":"","body":"* (fix) O3-5116: Close modal after editing billable service\n\n* updated translation for delete payment mode\n\n* updated\n\n* fixup\n\n* fix price input\n\n* Fixup\n\n1. Fix Concept UUID Capture - Changes concept type from ConceptSearchResult to { uuid: string; display: string }\n2. Fix Concept Initialization - When editing an existing service, properly extracts only `uuid` and `display` from `serviceToEdit.concept`\n3. Fix Translation Interpolation - Changes `{searchTerm}` → `{{searchTerm}}` (correct i18next syntax)\n4. Loader Styling Update - Updates CSS for the loader component\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>","authorName":"praneeth","authorEmail":"praneeth7077@gmail.com"},{"hash":"9c12676f7dd257f47f5ff22f4055fd6e0fd05ee9","date":"2025-10-15T21:55:32+03:00","message":"(fix) Exclude voided items from bill calculations (#437)","refs":"","body":"* (fix) Exclude voided items from bill calculations\n\nVoided (soft-deleted) line items were being included in bill totals,\nstatus calculations, and item lists, causing incorrect amounts and\nmisleading bill statuses.\n\nChanges:\n- Filter voided items in mapBillProperties before all calculations\n- Use calculateTotalAmount helper in bill waiver (includes voided check)\n- Refactor promise chains to async/await with try/catch/finally\n- Improve URL building in useBills with server-side status filtering\n- Add currency formatting for all price displays\n- Translate hardcoded strings in billing checkin form\n- Add accessibility improvements (aria-live on dynamic totals)\n- Remove unused code and imports\n\nTests:\n- Fix edit-bill-item tests broken by currency formatting changes\n- Add form validation test coverage for quantity constraints\n- Verify validation errors appear/clear correctly\n- Ensure submission is blocked with invalid data\n\nImpact: Bills with voided items will now show correct totals and status.\nPreviously, a fully paid bill could incorrectly show as PENDING if it\ncontained voided items.\n\n* Additional fix: register edit bill line item modal using modal system","authorName":"Dennis Kigen","authorEmail":"kigen.work@gmail.com"},{"hash":"cf4c767693faa707a9b1a2bf51b3e70ab936d37f","date":"2025-08-30T01:10:27+05:30","message":"(chore) Require @openmrs/esm-framework 8.x in peerDependencies (#350)","refs":"","body":"* Require @openmrs/esm-framework 8.x in peerDependencies\n\n* Delete .idea files","authorName":"Jayasanka Weerasinghe","authorEmail":"33048395+jayasanka-sack@users.noreply.github.com"}],"totalCount":13}"}],"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01EumKLaGkqf6FMDLwTMxTaR","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
